NAME: welcome home
PURPOSE: Runs a small set of commands when the user gets home. 
DIRECTORY: welcome_home
---
# Needs a Hue scene named "home" (saved with the hue tool's scene commands), and
# the wellness_check.task sample next to it. Meant to be started when the
# presence tool says you have arrived, or just by asking for it.
[TTS_OUTPUT:off]
With the tool hue, load the scene home.

# Then check in, if the subcon has anything to say. See wellness_check.task.
[RUN:wellness check]
